{EMBED HERE}
4.2434.89Pei teaches the "first cantilever 20" includes the "[s]econd cantilever drive device compris[ing] a servo motor 21, a second toothed belt transmission device and a hollow cycloidal reducer 22, the servo motor 21 is installed in the middle of the first cantilever 20, and the hollow cycloid reducer 22 is mounted on [t]he front end of the first cantilever 20." (Pei at p. 4 of machine translation.) Pei also teaches "the input shaft of the hollow cycloidal reducer 22 is driven by the servo motor 21 through the [second] toothed belt transmission, and the rear end 38 of the second cantilever 30 is fixed to the hollow cycloidal pinion[ o]n the output shaft of machine 22." (Pei at p. 4 of machine translation.) Moreover, Pei teaches the "second toothed belt transmission device comprises a driving pulley 23, toothed belt 24 and a driven pulley 25, the driving pulley 23 is fixed on the shaft of the servo motor 21, and the driven pulley 25 is fixed on the hollow cycloid reducer 22 [o]n the input shaft." (Pei at p. 4 of machine translation (emphasis added).)
